MID_BD17_10_m01: 
MID_BD17_10_m01_001: Brother! You went all red! What happened?
MID_BD17_10_m01_002: Hey, c'mon. You know me!
MID_BD17_10_m01_003: 
MID_BD17_10_m01_004: 
MID_BD17_10_m01_005: 
MID_BD17_10_m01_006: 
MID_BD17_10_m02: <TH>
MID_BD17_10_m02_001: I know you have a fierce sense of hatred right now,\nbut don't give in to it.
MID_BD17_10_m02_002: That feeling, that voice you hear—it's someone else's.\nYou can't let it take you over.
MID_BD17_10_m03: <TH>
MID_BD17_10_m03_001: I think I know how to save him.
MID_BD17_10_m03_002: It's alright! Please, put down your weapon.
MID_SC17_10_m01: 
MID_SC17_10_m01_001: I still can hardly believe it... You brought me back.
MID_SC17_10_m01_002: 
MID_SC17_10_m01_003: 
MID_SC17_10_m01_004: But...how can I possibly repay you?
MID_SC17_10_m01_005: Hmm. To start, you can promise not to lose\non purpose.
MID_SC17_10_m01_006: This ritual is important for the empire, so we both\nhave to do our best.
MID_SC17_10_m01_007: Heh. Alright. If that's your wish, I'll oblige and give\nit my all.
